{"title":"Global Citizenship in Local Communities and the Academy at The Forum in Tokyo","link":"https://iafor.org/global-citizenship-in-local-communities-and-the-academy-forum/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=global-citizenship-in-local-communities-and-the-academy-forum","date":1732074369000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/BCN-IAFOR-359_1500-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"Global Citizenship in Local Communities and the Academy at The Forum in Tokyo\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/BCN-IAFOR-359_1500-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/BCN-IAFOR-359_1500-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/BCN-IAFOR-359_1500-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/BCN-IAFOR-359_1500-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/BCN-IAFOR-359_1500-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/BCN-IAFOR-359_1500-32x32.jpg 32w\" />In an effort to reimagine academia’s role, and resituate it along the communities it is asked to serve, IAFOR invites delegates to join The Forum at ACE2024 to discuss community-assisted education, the university’s role within the local community, and how local communities and the Academy can work together to make a difference in the world. <a href=\"https://iafor.org/global-citizenship-in-local-communities-and-the-academy-forum/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/global-citizenship-in-local-communities-and-the-academy-forum/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"583c1976402880f92d512e8b853b591a179c73b1a5016e0053a2aca14fb37c67","category":"Interdisciplinary"}